    <div><span class="eyebrow">01 · STRATEGY</span><h2>Business Strategy</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">For founders and leadership teams who feel busy but not necessarily aligned on where the organisation is actually headed.</p></div>
    <div>
      <p>We help you clarify your vision, decide what matters most right now, and set a direction the whole team can repeat back without checking their notes. The result is a strategy that's specific enough to guide real decisions, not a document that sits in a drawer.</p>
