      <ul class="programme-list">
        <li>Strategic direction workshop with founders/leadership</li>
        <li>Vision and positioning statement</li>
        <li>Goal-setting and KPI framework</li>
        <li>Growth planning session</li>
        <li>Written strategy summary you can share with your team</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pale" id="business-planning">
  <div class="container two-col">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">02 · PLANNING</span><h2>Business Planning</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">For new ventures preparing to launch, and organisations that have never put their plan into a single, usable document.</p></div>
    <div>
      <p>An idea becomes real when it's written down in a way that supports actual decisions — what to spend on, what to say no to, and what "on track" looks like. We build that document with you, not for you, so you understand every part of it.</p>
      <h4>What's included</h4>
      <ul class="programme-list">
        <li>Full business plan document</li>
        <li>Operating plan covering day-to-day delivery</li>
        <li>Financial planning input (general guidance, not regulated advice)</li>
        <li>Action roadmap with milestones and owners</li>
        <li>One revision round after your feedback</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

